# Question 1
### AI-Assisted Loop Modification

```python
for i in range(5):
    print(i)
```

Use Copilot to modify the loop to calculate Factorial numbers up to the 15th term. The output should be displayed as a list of factorials from 1! to 15!, with each result shown alongside its position (e.g., "1! = 1", "2! = 2", "3! = 6", etc.). Ensure your solution handles large numbers appropriately.

